{"page":80,"verses":[{"verse_key":"4:15","surah":4,"ayah":15,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱلَّـٰتِى يَأْتِينَ ٱلْفَـٰحِشَةَ مِن نِّسَآئِكُمْ فَٱسْتَشْهِدُوا۟ عَلَيْهِنَّ أَرْبَعَةً مِّنكُمْ ۖ فَإِن شَهِدُوا۟ فَأَمْسِكُوهُنَّ فِى ٱلْبُيُوتِ حَتَّىٰ يَتَوَفَّىٰهُنَّ ٱلْمَوْتُ أَوْ يَجْعَلَ ٱللَّهُ لَهُنَّ سَبِيلًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If any of your women commit a lewd act, call four witnesses from among you, then, if they testify to their guilt, keep the women at home until death comes to them or until God shows them another way.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱلَّـٰتِى","en_gloss":"And those who","transliteration":"wa-allātī","verse_key":"4:15"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَأْتِينَ","en_gloss":"commit","transliteration":"yatīna","verse_key":"4:15"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْفَـٰحِشَةَ","en_gloss":"[the] immorality","transliteration":"l-fāḥishata","verse_key":"4:15"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"4:15"},{"pos":5,"ar":"نِّسَآئِكُمْ","en_gloss":"your women","transliteration":"nisāikum","verse_key":"4:15"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَٱسْتَشْهِدُوا۟","en_gloss":"then call to witness","transliteration":"fa-is'tashhidū","verse_key":"4:15"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَلَيْهِنَّ","en_gloss":"against them","transliteration":"ʿalayhinna","verse_key":"4:15"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَرْبَعَةًۭ","en_gloss":"four","transliteration":"arbaʿatan","verse_key":"4:15"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِّنكُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"among you","transliteration":"minkum","verse_key":"4:15"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَإِن","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"fa-in","verse_key":"4:15"},{"pos":11,"ar":"شَهِدُوا۟","en_gloss":"they testify","transliteration":"shahidū","verse_key":"4:15"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فَأَمْسِكُوهُنَّ","en_gloss":"then confine them","transliteration":"fa-amsikūhunna","verse_key":"4:15"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"4:15"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلْبُيُوتِ","en_gloss":"their houses","transliteration":"l-buyūti","verse_key":"4:15"},{"pos":15,"ar":"حَتَّىٰ","en_gloss":"until","trans